Null expectation for a 1-df/5-df split: E[R2] = 1/6 = 0.167.
The correct (within-CC) R2 values sit AT or near that null and no permutation p is
significant -> the honest conclusion is UNDERPOWERED / indistinguishable from chance,
NOT 'site explains only 4-6%'. Do not quote the global_pc_subset row.

